Mon Aug 31 11:05:06 UTC 2026 - Martin Hauke <mardnh@gmx.de>

- Update to version 1.20.0
  * Implement SIMD-accelerated masked literal matching.
  * Improve atom extraction heuristics for better performance.
  * Improve scan performance by applying file size and file header
    constraints only to regular expressions.
  * Serialize Aho-Corasick automata directly with compiled rules
    for faster deserialization.
  * Add --ignore-invalid-rules CLI option to skip rules that fail
    to compile.
  * Expose ignore_invalid_rules in Python API.
  * Add type annotations to match and return data in Python API.
  * Add yrx_scanner_max_matches_per_pattern to C API and
    Scanner.MaxMatchedPerPattern to Go API.
  * Add rlib crate types to yara-x-capi and yara-x-py to allow
    linking into wrapper crates.
  * Implement experimental msi, vba, and olecf modules.
  * Parse ShellItems and malformed sections in lnk module.
  * Raise warning when patterns are unintendedly included in a set.
  * Improve code completion in language server by distinguishing
    enums from other fields.
  * Improve playground usability and add light/dark theme support.
  * BUGFIX: Prevent panics and provide clear error message for
    regular expressions exceeding size limits.
  * BUGFIX: Prevent panic when filesize is compared to float values
  * BUGFIX: Allow Teddy pattern matching algorithm to propagate
    early termination and respect timeouts.
  * BUGFIX: Correctly anchor patterns in of expressions with
    explicit offsets.
  * BUGFIX: Properly report compile error when exceeding maximum
    local variables limit.
  * BUGFIX: Escape special control characters in JSON and YAML
    serialization.
  * BUGFIX: Do not ignore private modifier on hex and regular
    expression patterns.
  * BUGFIX: Cap ZIP buffer pre-allocation to compressed size.
  * BUGFIX: Robustly encode 64-bit string handles for WASM.
  * BUGFIX: Align completions with default formatting in language
    server.
  * BUGFIX: Fix accuracy issues when computing profiling time spent
    on each rule.
  * BUGFIX: Prevent naming conflicts in Python bindings by setting
    module name explicitly to yara_x.
  * BUGFIX: Add protection against null pointers in C API.

-------------------------------------------------------------------
